# File upload (dropzone)

Use **`app-file-dropzone`** or **`app-single-file-dropzone`** (same component, two selectors) in `admin/src/app/ui/single-file-dropzone/`.

For **profile or logo images** (PNG/JPEG/GIF/WebP), use **`app-avatar-dropzone`** (`admin/src/app/ui/avatar-dropzone/`).

## Single vs multi

- **`[multiple]="false"`** (default) — one file; `(fileChange)` emits the file; optional preview until parent saves or clears.
- **`[multiple]="true"`** — `(filesChange)` emits `File[]`.

## Layout

- **`layout="inline"`** (default) — compact row for form fields (receipts, form FILE questions).
- **`layout="panel"`** — dashed drop zone (artifacts list, task attachments). Optional `[showBrowseButton]="true"`, `[zoneOpensPicker]="false"` when a toolbar button calls `openPicker()` via `#ref`.

## Pick vs hold

- **`pickMode="false"`** (default) — keeps selection for preview until parent clears or `reset()`.
- **`pickMode="true"`** — emit and reset immediately (multi attach uploads, form FILE upload-on-pick).

Optional: `[uploading]`, `[uploadProgress]` for panel progress text.

## Do not

- Visible native `<input type="file">` on admin forms when the dropzone fits
- One-off “Choose file” / duplicate panel dropzone markup when `layout="panel"` covers it

## OK to keep hidden file inputs

- **CSV imports** (bank import, timesheet) — base64 API, not object storage dropzone
- **Quill** embedded image/file handlers
- **Public form** token upload (separate flow)

## Reference

| Use case | Control |
|----------|---------|
| Person / user avatar | `app-avatar-dropzone` |
| Company logo (Settings) | `app-avatar-dropzone` with `thumbShape="square"`, `fill` |
| Expense receipt | `app-single-file-dropzone` inline, `fill` |
| Task / artifact attachments | `app-file-dropzone` panel, `multiple`, `pickMode` |
| Public task form FILE question | inline, `[multiple]` as needed, `pickMode` |

Pass `(invalidFile)` for validation; call `reset()` when the parent dialog reopens.
